# IsoRim animals batch herd2 (blob style): Boomalope, Ibex ram + doe, Gazelle, Elephant, Rhinoceros. Generated by
# tools/make_herd2_concept.py (boomalope from the v1 run, the others from v2; merged into this one file at integration, 2026-11-16).
# Kd = the sprite lit white (0.96); the textures hold the sprite colours relative to that white.
# Gazelle, rhino, boomalope: colours baked (gazelle and rhino are untinted in vanilla; the boomalope's CutoutComplex tint is baked).
# Ibex, elephant: coat colour from the game (ModelDef tintFromGraphic, Api 49: ibex ram (136,100,75), doe and kids (153,129,113),
# elephant (130,126,119)); the review stand-in Kd (vanilla tint x 0.96) was replaced by the lit white at integration.
# Their _horn / _beard / _tuft / _tusk materials are plain, which tintFromGraphic leaves untinted (ibex: outside the
# CutoutComplex mask; elephant: ivory tusks).
newmtl an_boomalope_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Boomalope

newmtl an_gazelle_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Gazelle

newmtl an_ibex_female_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/IbexFemale

newmtl an_ibex_female_blob_beard
Kd 0.290 0.219 0.157

newmtl an_ibex_female_blob_horn
Kd 0.478 0.400 0.274

newmtl an_ibex_female_blob_tuft
Kd 0.290 0.219 0.157

newmtl an_ibex_male_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/IbexMale

newmtl an_ibex_male_blob_beard
Kd 0.290 0.219 0.157

newmtl an_ibex_male_blob_horn
Kd 0.478 0.400 0.274

newmtl an_ibex_male_blob_tuft
Kd 0.290 0.219 0.157

newmtl an_elephant_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Elephant

newmtl an_elephant_blob_tusk
Kd 0.925 0.901 0.807

newmtl an_rhino_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Rhino
